  "body": "[`UIEvent.cancelBubble`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/UIEvent/cancelBubble) works in all modern browsers.\nTestcase: http://jsbin.com/jufexu/edit?html,css,js,output\n\n[`Event.cancelBubble`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Event/cancelBubble) works in all modern browsers (Chrome, Safari, Edge, IE11) except Firefox.\nTestcase: http://jsbin.com/wirelo/edit?html,js,output\n\nTo accurately reflect reality, I propose speccing at least one of these properties.\n",
